@startuml RideDiagram
actor Driver

Driver -> App : Open Home Screen
App -> Driver : Show "Start Ride" action
Driver -> App : Tap "Start Ride"
App -> Backend : Create ride session
Backend -> App : Ride session created
App -> Driver : Show riding screen (map, timer, speed, distance)

loop every <=5s (NFR.4)
    App -> Backend : Upload latest GPS sample
    App -> Driver : Update distance display
end

... Driver drives with advertisement mounted ...

Driver -> App : Tap "End Ride"
App -> Backend : End ride session
Backend -> Backend : Compute distance, duration, avg speed, earnings
Backend -> App : Ride result + persisted ride (status = unverified)

App -> Driver : Prompt to scan QR code on vehicle

alt QR scanned successfully
    Driver -> App : Scan QR code
    App -> Backend : Verify ride (rideId)
    Backend -> Backend : Set status = verified
    Backend -> App : OK
    App -> Driver : Confirm verified, return to home
else Driver leaves before scan
    App -> Driver : Return to home (ride remains unverified)
end

@enduml
